Thought: The fragments suggest presence of a benzene ring. Given the molecular mass and fragments, this could be aspirin (acetylsalicylic acid) with formula C9H8O4. Let me validate this hypothesis by checking the SMILES notation for aspirin.
Action: validate_smiles
